Cancel a document
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/doc/cancel
Request
Body

application/json

sid
string
Session ID

doctype
string
required
Document type

docnum
integer
required
Document number

refund_cc
boolean
Refund credit-card transaction. Will throw an error if there is no cc transaction in document, or if refund failed.

reason
string
Cancellation reason

Responses
200
OK

